WEBVTT

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:11.200
Aya!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:16.170
It's an emergency!

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.260
Alice and Karen are fighting!

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.910
What?! Are they fighting over Shino again?!

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.180
Get up, Alice.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.800
I know you're stronger than that.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:41.560
Pant
Pant

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.360
There's no room for weakness
on this sacred court.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.480
Understand?

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:40.260
Huh? What's going on?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.560
<i>Wait, this is...</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.000
<i>They just took inspiration from a manga!</i>

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.000
Make-Believe

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.850
Ringlets...

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.720
They're so bright...

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:29.330
Episode 9
A Special Day

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.550
It's morning?

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.090
Oh, right...

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:41.500
Summer vacation starts
today, so I can sleep in.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.900
This is heaven.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.700
Stare.

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.640
Stare.

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.840
Alice, good mornin'.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.680
Karen, what are you doing up
this early in the morning?

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.330
I wanted to split a watermelon.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:06.870
Split a... watermelon?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.080
Snore

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.410
Don't! Not next to my bed!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.710
I've been dying to split it since yesterday.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.580
Snore

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.130
Shino, wake up! Karen's going to...

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.080
Snore

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.770
Now, let's smash this watermelon!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.670
Spin, spin, spin!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.380
Wake up, Shino!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.390
This Year,
There'll Be No Crying on the Last Day

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.390
Homework Breakdown Schedule

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.390
There, that should do it.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.080
We're all going to the beach this year,

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.890
so we should finish our homework early.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.050
With this, even Youko should be...

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:36.290
<i>Come to think of it, on all of our
previous summer vacations...</i>

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.280
Middle School Year One

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.280
~~~ Last Day of Summer Vacation ~~~

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.650
Please, Aya!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.590
Help me with my homework!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.280
Middle School Year Two

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.280
~~~ Last Day of Summer Vacation ~~~

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.910
Can you help me again?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.660
Middle School Year Three

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.660
~~~ Last Day of Summer Vacation ~~~

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.170
I'm sorry!

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.540
On top of that, last year...

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.550
— Last Summer —

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:03.020
We're in high school now.
Why do we have homework?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:08.220
This year, Youko will have a perfectly
planned-out summer vacation!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:14.440
The only problem is,
how do I give this to her?

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.060
Pool! Pool!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.220
The school pool!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:24.150
Kouta! Mitsuki! Make sure you've
got everything before you leave.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.170
Pool! Pool!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.100
The school pool!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:24.150
Pool!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.200
Okay.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.190
Aya?

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:29.950
Hello?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:34.240
I-Is this Inokuma Youko-san?

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.160
Yeah, it is.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.460
What's wrong?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.510
What was that?

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.800
I can't find my swimming cap!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.730
Where's my bunny towel, Onee-chan?

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.470
Okay, okay, just give me a second.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.480
That phone call was a total failure.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:02.230
If I call her like that on the
first day of summer vacation...

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:10.370
I can't believe you gave me a call
like that. You disappoint me, Aya.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:13.070
N-No, that was...

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.190
Goodbye.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.120
Wait, Youko!

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:17.790
Youko!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.850
I should follow up with an e-mail...

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:30.090
Composing E-mail

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:30.090
Inokuma Youko

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:30.090
Earlier

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:29.030
"Sorry for panting at you
over the phone earlier."

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:34.340
That'll just make it worse!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.580
It's so hot...

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.750
I left the house without thinking.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:46.980
<i>Come to think of it, this might be my
first time going to Youko's house alone.</i>

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.480
I should go home.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.860
<i>Yeah. What if I get there,
and she's not home?</i>

00:05:56.860 --> 00:06:00.370
<i>It's bad manners to visit someone
without contacting them first, anyway.</i>

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.620
<i>If I visit, I should at least bring a gift.</i>

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.010
Oh, Aya?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:11.960
Youko...

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.540
What was that phone call about earlier?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.970
I was worried since you hung up so suddenly.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:20.400
Oh, that was... nothing.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:23.130
By the way, where are you right now?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.400
At home?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.180
No, I'm out.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.230
Oh...

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:31.040
Oh, I can see a pigtailed
girl right in front of me!

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:31.730
What?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.660
Hey!

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:38.450
What are you doing here, you idiot?!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.990
This already?!

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.510
I'm glad we didn't miss each other.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:47.250
I was just on my way to your place.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:48.460
Really?

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.680
Where are Kouta-kun and Mitsuki-chan?

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.010
They went to the pool at school.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:59.010
<i>Which means... we're alone?</i>

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.790
Here you go.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.690
What? Oh, don't worry about me.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:06.550
I'm not worried about you.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.410
So what's up?

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:11.020
Oh, right. I forgot.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.520
Here!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.780
"This Year, There'll Be No
Crying on the Last Day..."

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.190
"Homework Breakdown Schedule?!"

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.750
You should plan your vacation
from the very first day!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.510
Starting today, you'll do your
homework according to this schedule!

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:26.790
What?!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:33.650
<i>She's looking at me...</i>

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.640
Wh-What is it?

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.790
Oh, nothing...

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:42.510
I was just thinking that I don't have
a single girly outfit like yours.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.760
Girly?

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:45.820
Yeah.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:50.330
Would you like to try it on?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.900
This feels so weird!

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.020
How do I look?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:01.100
Well, it's... sort of...

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.580
It doesn't look right on me, does it?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.350
Besides, it's a little tight
right around here...

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:14.710
Well, I'm sorry mine are so small!

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.090
I never said—

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:19.480
Stop it! Stop it! I give up!

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.320
I'll wash these before I return them.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.470
It's fine.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:28.280
But I wouldn't want to return them dirty.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.380
A little sweat is no big deal.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.600
I'm going to wash them!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:33.190
Wait...

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.810
We're home.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.810
Um...

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.620
Did we interrupt?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.090
We can go back outside for a bit.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:49.200
Ah, no! You've got it all wrong!

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.980
Youko, say something!

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.140
Nothing could be worse than this!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.950
Can we have popsicles, Onee-chan?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.590
Sure, but just one each.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.590
Okay.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.450
Here.

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:13.240
Are you sure?

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.230
It's okay. When you do this...

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:21.050
This is how friends eat them.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.610
Friends...

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.900
Here, Youko.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.960
It's okay, I'll take this one. You're my guest.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.620
But I'd feel bad...

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:36.680
In that case...

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:43.260
It's so good!

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.870
See? We're even now, right?

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.900
Youko, you jerk!

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:55.020
What?! You <i>did</i> want to eat that one, then?!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:59.020
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.990
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.810
Everyone's practicing hard.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.860
Yeah. The practice match is coming up,

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.700
so I need to work hard, too.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:23.600
I wonder what Karen-chan's doing right now.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:28.140
I feel so relaxed at your house, Shino.

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:33.100
You've been coming over every day
since summer vacation started.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.080
Have I been bothering you?!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.290
Of course not.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.400
I'm glad I get to see you every day.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:43.830
Don't worry about me.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.390
I'll be good.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.380
You're such a good girl, Karen.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:48.780
By the way,

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.810
I want nagashi somen for lunch today.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.790
You can only be so impudent!

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:56.960
I can ask my mom to make somen noodles,

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.420
but I'm not sure we can do nagashi somen.

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:00.890
Oh...

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:04.100
It looked so fun on TV...

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.400
It's fun seeing you two every day,

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.990
but I've been a little bored lately.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:13.970
Why don't you read a book, then?

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:16.180
This one's really interesting.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:21.060
It should be perfect for the
book report we were assigned.

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.530
I'll save it for tomorrow.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:29.180
Why don't we play cards?

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.220
I'm tired of that.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:35.580
I want to spice things up with something new.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.540
We could have super spicy somen for lunch!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.740
With canned tangerines?

00:11:43.740 --> 00:11:44.980
Of course.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.870
I'll go let my mom know right now.

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.850
Don't, Shino!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:52.090
Thanks for lunch.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:56.600
This year, I'm thinking about making
a summer vacation debut.

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:58.900
A summer vacation debut?

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.030
What are you going to debut as? An idol?

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.860
No, Karen. A summer vacation debut means...

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:10.610
changing your look over summer vacation!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.120
Oh, I've heard of that!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.740
You mean like growing your hair out

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.890
an extra 30 centimeters.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:18.910
So scary!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.250
Only some kind of curse could do that!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.340
I'm actually thinking of going to the salon today.

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:28.460
What? Really?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:33.710
Yes. I was going to keep it a secret
and surprise you all, but...

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:39.980
Shino, you're not going to dye
your hair blonde, are you?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.410
Oh, right, I could do that...

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.730
Forget I said anything!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.970
I'm excited to see you blonde.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.240
No blonde hair!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.960
You're going out?

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.070
Yes. I'm going to the salon.

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:58.950
I'm off to make my summer vacation debut.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.980
R-Really...

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:04.790
We're taking Shino there
while we go for a walk.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.590
Could you pick up some ice
cream on your way home?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.190
You can pick some out for yourselves, too.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:11.650
Yay!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:14.480
Oh! Your body might be slim,

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.840
but your heart is so big!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.530
Okay, I'm going in.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:21.070
Good luck, Shino!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.730
I can't wait to see!

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:28.250
Let's go shopping and head back home.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.150
Oh, I forgot!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:31.110
What's wrong?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:35.490
Alice, can we make a quick stop first?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.180
<i>Don't hesitate.</i>

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:44.500
<i>Focus on this one shot.</i>

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.430
Honoka!

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.130
Karen-chan?!

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:01.100
<i>My name is Matsubara Honoka.</i>

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:05.600
<i>I sat next to Karen-chan in our first year.</i>

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:10.860
<i>She's always so cheerful and
blindingly bright, but sometimes...</i>

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.380
Medic! Medic!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.570
Karen!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.370
<i>...she does crazy things.</i>

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:23.900
Sorry I made you worry. I'm okay.

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.000
Thank goodness.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.630
So you're on the tennis team?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.650
Yeah.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.240
She's aiming for the ace!

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:33.220
That's so cool!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:35.130
Can you hit a fireball smash?

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.210
Um, I'm on the team,

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.000
but I'm not very good...

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.640
The only thing I'm good at is balancing on a ball.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.890
That's amazing, but it has
nothing to do with tennis!

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:51.780
Shinobu-chan's making a
summer vacation debut?

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:54.080
I look forward to seeing that.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.110
Do you want to go see her?

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.780
But wouldn't I be bothering her?

00:14:58.180 --> 00:14:59.720
Of course not!

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:03.170
Let's all celebrate Shino's
summer vacation debut with her!

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:06.980
Okay.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.730
We got the ice cream.

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.610
I wonder how Shino's doing.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.070
She's probably super spicy Shino by now.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:20.300
What? I hope not!

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.180
<i>They're just like princesses...</i>

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.410
Hey!

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:34.440
Oh, you're on the tennis team, Honoka?

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:38.170
Yeah. Aren't you going to join a club?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.410
I heard you were pretty athletic.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.410
Why don't you join our team?

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:45.450
Well...

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.040
Oh, no...

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:50.160
Now that we're not classmates,
if she joins a club,

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:53.090
we'll hardly ever see each other!

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.650
Oh, I won't force her.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.240
What?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.720
<i>I said that out loud!</i>

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:02.340
By the way, where are you two headed?

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.230
We're going to borrow some
books from the library.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.770
You know, for that book
report we all have to do.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.530
I can't hear you! I can't hear you!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:15.980
<i>Karen and Shino might need that schedule, too...</i>

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.920
Okay, so we'll see you later.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.820
See you later!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:23.820
Bye!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.360
It sure is hot today, isn't it?

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:36.500
You're wiping your sweat with bills?
That's a little offensive!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.040
And this is fake, isn't it?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.130
Of course.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:43.100
<i>I can definitely believe her family's rich.</i>

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.550
<i>I'll try that, too.</i>

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.100
Why are you competing with her?!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.390
Alice, Karen, you're late.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:56.650
Shino, you look so cute!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.860
You're like a real kokeshi doll!

00:16:58.860 --> 00:16:59.650
What?!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:02.050
Y-You're spicy.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.320
I think it looks nice and summery.

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:07.240
Oh, Honoka-chan, you're here, too?

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.160
Pardon the intrusion.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.450
I'm sorry! I'm not dressed for company!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:12.410
Wh-What?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.400
Give me a minute!

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:17.670
~ Several Minutes Later ~

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:20.060
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.420
Whew, I'm safe!

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:24.360
No, you're out.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.430
Thanks for waiting.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.130
We bought ice cream.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.310
Thanks.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.760
I know you like yours a little melted,

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:33.630
so we melted it lots for you.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.940
Yes, this is just perfect...

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:39.290
What the heck?!

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.950
Sigh

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.030
<i>O-Onee-chan played along
before reacting to it?</i>

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.700
<i>She must really be depressed.</i>

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.200
Swift as Wind
Silent as Forest
Fierce as Fire
Immovable as Mountain

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:55.210
I'm jealous you get to eat tasty parfaits
every day where you work, Honoka.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.370
You shouldn't be.

00:17:57.670 --> 00:18:00.840
I'd rather do what you and Alice-chan do...

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:08.300
Eating ice cream when you've
run out of bread is très bien.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.810
I'm jealous of you, too, Shinobu-chan.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.180
You're surrounded by two
glowing girls every day.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:21.340
Yes, I'm very happy.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.320
Oh, yeah!

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:25.270
There's something I wanted to show you

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.700
as the other member of the Blonde Alliance.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.370
Did you make all of these yourself?

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:41.430
Yes. It's really fun matching the colors
and designs to Alice's hair and eyes.

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.640
Incredible. They're like real princess dresses.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.720
I have even more.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.400
Look at this one.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.840
It's so cute!

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.770
I'm quite proud of this one.

00:18:54.090 --> 00:18:58.270
Oh! We should have an Alice Fashion Show!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.650
Really, Alice?

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.110
Wow, can we?

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.370
Wh-What?

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:31.930
Honoka-chan, come visit again anytime.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.720
Thanks, I will.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.380
See you tomorrow!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.400
Goodbye.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.640
Bye-bye.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:46.580
<i>Today didn't turn out anything like I'd pictured.</i>

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.960
<i>But I had fun.</i>

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:49.930
Oh, right!

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:53.850
We're all going to the beach next week.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.790
Would you like to come with us?

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.560
We're going on this day.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.190
I have a practice match that day...

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:04.350
You're playing in a match?

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.420
That's amazing!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:09.800
But I'm worried I'll hold back my team...

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.480
Do you know any good luck charms?

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.060
Oh! In that case...

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.560
Back and forth, back and forth...

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.730
You are now a tennis star.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.560
That's hypnosis!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:29.570
It's okay. I know you can win.

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:32.700
I'll pray to the sun!

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:38.260
But what if it rains?

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:43.370
Tennis matches are called if it rains.
You couldn't go to the beach, either.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.240
You're right!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.590
Well, if we have to cancel our plans,

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.340
why don't we go somewhere together?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.530
Okay!

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:57.200
Honoka, fight!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.850
Thanks.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.530
Okay!

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:52.800
— The Day of the Match —

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:57.250
Honoka, you're playing great today.

00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:58.430
You think so?

00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:00.680
Did something good happen?

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:04.180
Maybe I should be thanking the sun.

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.190
Thank you!

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.070
Karen, let's go!

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:15.530
Oh! I'll be right there!

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:22.530
Kouta...

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:23.490
...and Mitsuki's...

00:23:23.490 --> 00:23:25.770
...Episode Preview, Part 2.

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:28.070
The next episode is the beach episode,

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.780
but due to certain circumstances,
the broadcast will be altered.

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.450
Don't tell such sad lies!

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:32.450
No!

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:34.530
Oh, you guys wanted to go with us, huh?

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:33.420
Don't miss it

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:34.090
Sorry

00:23:34.090 --> 00:23:36.090
#10 Seaside Promise

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:36.090
See you next time!
